      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\nLorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since 1966, \nwhen designers at Letraset and James Mosley, the librarian at St Bride Printing Library in London, \ntook a 1914 Cicero translation and scrambled it to make dummy text for Letraset's Body Type \nsheets. It has survived not only many decades, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, \nremaining essentially unchanged.\n.",
